<Solution>
  <!-- Pinta.Brix.WithAndroid.slnx
       The Android solution: everything in Pinta.Brix.slnx PLUS the Android head and the
       .Android twins of its library projects, which need the .NET Android workload.
       Open Pinta.Brix.slnx instead if you only have the plain .NET SDK. -->
